OL,5,G1500 Jaz Singh
OL,6,     FWith the World Cup now underway,
OL,7,     FJaz wants to hear your horror
OL,8,     Fstories. He's giving the mic to
OL,9,     Feveryone with a football-obsessed
OL,10,     Fpartner, who's had the footy
OL,11,     Finterrupt their plans!
OL,12,G1745 Newsbeat @ 17:45
OL,13,     FThe latest news from around the UK
OL,14,     Fand around the world.
